# User's own local screen recordings (e.g. bug-report clips) -- not
# meant to be tracked; a `git add -A` swept one into a commit once,
# caught and amended out before push (2026-09-21).
datalog/
# Phone Model asset source material (2026-09-27) -- the app only ever
# loads the top-level *.glb files in this folder (see
# PHONE_MODEL_OPTIONS, src/main.js); the .zip archives, .blend/.blend1
# working files, and extracted source/textures subfolders are raw
# provenance (~104MB), not runtime assets -- excluded per workspace
# CLAUDE.md Section 11 ("exclude only genuinely large/regenerable
# material"), kept locally rather than committed.
data/processed/SMARTPHONE MODELS/*.zip
data/processed/SMARTPHONE MODELS/*.blend
data/processed/SMARTPHONE MODELS/*.blend1
